# Wave T50 (Fenland kit): lilypad — two lily pads on Fenland's south pool and the BOGNEWT itself: a tiny frog seated on the big pad, a pink bud on the small one. ODO's tenancy made dressing ('MUDGILL own the south pools and sublet to the BOGNEWT — I pay rent in patience'), seated beside the bogeyes per the Backstory Sync Audit row; no actor, no dialogue, no event invented. Fully opaque: the pool is baked in at the MEASURED marshbog colours. (WAVE-T50-FENLAND-PLAN.md §5.)
